p -q 'type Runtime interface' internal/runtime/*.go`、`grep -q 'type RuntimeEnv interface' internal/env/*.go`、`grep -q 'type RuntimeBuilder interface' internal/builder/*.go` 三接口就位；`grep -rniE 'type .*dsh|dshRuntime|dshEnv|dshBuilder|NewDsh' internal/ cmd/` = 0（无 dsh 类型/实现/构造；代码注释中的「dsh」豁免）；`grep -rn 'piRuntime' internal/handler/` 无命中（handler 依赖接口非具体实现）；`grep -q '\"runtime\"' internal/config/config.go` 字段就位\"\n\nSo the check `grep -rn 'piRuntime' internal/handler/` 无命中 is a hard acceptance criterion. Currently it's 2 hits. This is a genuine failure.\n\nI think task12 should fix this. The task12 title is \"三个 O 端到端验收 + README/wiki 文档同步\", and KR8 is part of \"三个 O\" acceptance (O2 specifically covers the module responsibilities, and the extension seam is part of the spec).\n\nActually, looking more carefully, the \"三个 O\" acceptance list is:\n- O1 (spec 信息内核)\n- O2 (三层金字塔 + 做薄)\n- O3 (pibuilder pi 对齐)\n\nAnd KR8 \"扩展点验收\" is about the extension seams (Runtime/RuntimeEnv/RuntimeBuilder interfaces + config runtime field + handler not depending on concrete impl). This is related to O2's \"做薄\" and the spec's §3.5.\n\nSo yes, I need to fix the handler to not depend on the concrete `piRuntime`.\n\nBut wait — how big a change is this? Let me think about the minimal fix:\n\nThe handler's `Doing` function constructs `runtime.NewPiRuntime(cfg.PiPath, cfg.PiExtraArgs...)` and calls `piRuntime.Run(...)`.\n\nThe fix: inject the `Runtime` interface into the handler. The composition root (cmd) should construct `runtime.NewPiRuntime` and pass it to `handler.Doing`.\n\nOptions:\n1. Add a `Runtime runtime.Runtime` field to `handler.Options`. Then cmd constructs it and sets it. But `Options` is currently just flag values. Adding a runtime interface to it is a bit odd but workable.\n2. Add a parameter to `Doing(jobID string, opts Options, rt runtime.Runtime)`.\n3. Add a package-level function to set the runtime factory.\n\nGiven the existing pattern (Options struct carries flag values), 