{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Now I understand the full picture of what needs to change:\n\n1. `tests/tools_integration_test.sh` needs rewrite (KR6). The scenarios:\n   - Scenario 1, 2, 3 (plan_check) — deleted command, need to remove/rewrite\n   - Scenario 4, 5, 6 (doing_check) — deleted command, need to remove/rewrite as pi-side gate script verification\n   - Scenario 7 (learning_success + merge) — delete merge/branch assertions, keep learning_check\n   - Scenario 8 (learning_bad_skill) — this one expects \"syntax error\" but learning_check now passes. Wait, the KR6 says \"场景 7 只删 merge/branch 断言、保留 learning_check 断言\". It doesn't mention scenario 8 or 9. Let me re-read.\n\nKR6: \"同步改写 tests/tools_integration_test.sh（task8 已删 plan_check/doing_check，该脚本场景 1,2,3,4,5,6,11 依赖被删命令需删除或改写为 pi 侧门禁脚本验证；场景 7 只删 merge/branch 断言、保留 learning_check 断言）后再跑，并与 mock_agent 对齐\"\n\nSo:\n- 场景 1,2,3 (plan_check) → delete or rewrite\n- 场景 4,5,6 (doing_check) → delete or rewrite as pi-side gate script verification (i.e., verify the rick-gates helper.py works)\n- 场景 11 (rick tools --help shows plan_check/doing_check) → delete or rewrite\n- 场景 7 (learning_success + merge) → only delete merge/branch assertions, keep learning_check assertion\n- Scenario 8 (learning_bad_skill) — expects \"syntax error\" but now learning_check passes. Hmm.\n\nWait, scenario 8: `learning_bad_skill → learning_check reports syntax error`. The current learning_check now passes for bad_skill scenario? Let me check what learning_check does now. Actually the mock_agent's learning_bad_skill scenario might have changed. Let me check the mock_agent.\n\nActually, let me first understand the mock_agent scenarios and what learning_check does now. The learning_check (tools_learning_check.go) validates learning directory structure.\n\nLet me look at the mock_agent and check_mechanism_skill to understand what scenarios exist and what learning_check expects.\n\nActually, let me focus. The KR6 is clear about what to change:\n- 场景 1,2,3,4,5,6,11: delete or rewrite (these depend on deleted plan_check/doing_check)\n- 场景 7: delete merge/branch assertions, keep learning_check assertion\n\nScenario 8 (learning_bad_skill) is NOT mentioned in KR6, but it currently fails (\"learning check passed\" when expecting \"syntax error\"). Let me check if this is a real issue or if the mock_agent needs alignment.\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read: \"并与 mock_agent 对齐\" (and align with mock_agent). This suggests the mock_agent might need updating too.\n\nLet me look at the mock_agent and the learning_check to understand scenario 8.\n\nLet me check what learning_check does now."}}
