{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"The wiki is ~11k lines and heavily outdated. This is a large documentation rewrite task. Given the constraints of the task and the goal of consistency, I need to be strategic.\n\nThe cleanest approach: rewrite the wiki to be a smaller, accurate set of documents that reflect the new architecture. I'll:\n\n1. Rewrite `wiki/README.md` (index) — concise, accurate.\n2. Rewrite `wiki/architecture.md` — three-layer pyramid + spec info kernel + env four responsibilities + sinking strategy.\n3. Delete obsolete modules: `modules/executor.md`, `modules/git.md`, `modules/parser.md`.\n4. Add new modules: `modules/handler.md`, `modules/env.md`, `modules/builder.md`, `modules/runtime.md`.\n5. Rewrite `modules/cmd.md`, `modules/config.md`, `modules/workspace.md`, `modules/prompt.md`, `modules/human-loop.md` (make concise/accurate).\n6. Replace `dag-execution.md` with a sinking-strategy doc (or delete it and reference the new orchestration). Actually, since the file name is misleading and DAG is gone, I'll rewrite it as `orchestration.md` (pi workflowScript) and delete `dag-execution.md`. Or simpler: delete dag-execution.md and cover orchestration in runtime-flow.md.\n\nHmm, this is a huge amount of writing. Let me be efficient and produce accurate, concise docs. The key is accuracy and consistency, not volume.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the scope. The task's KR7 is focused on: \"同步三层金字塔 + spec 信息内核 + env 四职责 + 下沉策略\". So the KEY content is these four things. I need to ensure:\n1. 三层金字塔 (three-layer pyramid) is documented.\n2. spec 信息内核 (spec info kernel) is documented.\n3. env 四职责 (env four responsibilities) is documented.\n4. 下沉策略 (sinking strategy) is documented.\n5. No outdated references remain.\n\nThe most efficient correct approach:\n1. Rewrite README.md with all four concepts.\n2. Rewrite wiki/README.md as accurate index.\n3. Rewrite wiki/architecture.md with the four concepts (this is the \"深入\" doc).\n4. Delete obsolete module files (executor/git/parser).\n5. Add new module files (handler/env/builder/runtime) — but to keep it manageable, I can add a single consolidated doc or a few concise ones.\n6. Rewrite/update the remaining wiki files to remove outdated references.\n\nLet me prioritize. I'll do a thorough job but keep each doc concise and accurate. Given the huge volume of outdated content, I'll rewrite the following files completely:\n- wiki/README.md\n- wiki/architecture.md\n- wiki/modules/cmd.md\n- wiki/modules/config.md\n- wiki/modules/workspace.md\n- wiki/modules/prompt.md\n- wiki/modules/human-loop.md\n- wiki/runtime-flow.md (rewrite to reflect new flow: env→builder→runtime)\n- wiki/testing.md (rewrite to reflect new testing)\n- wiki/prompt-system.md (rewrite)\n- wiki/installation.md (rewrite)\n\nDelete:\n- wiki/modules/executor.md\n- wiki/modules/git.md\n- wiki/modules/parser.md\n- wiki/dag-execution.md (DAG deleted)\n\nAdd:\n- wiki/modules/handler.md\n- wiki/modules/env.md\n- wiki/modules/builder.md\n- wiki/modules/runtime.md\n\nThis is a lot, but I'll write concise accurate docs.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The CONTRIBUTING.md, validate_wiki.sh, VALIDATION_REPORT.md are meta-docs. The validate_wiki.sh references outdated stuff but it's a validation script. The VALIDATION_REPORT.md is a stale report. I should:\n- Update or delete VALIDATION_REPORT.md (stale).\n- Update validate_wiki.sh (it has outdated grep patterns).\n- CONTRIBUTING.md is mostly generic — but it might reference SPEC/OKR. Let me check and lightly update.\n\nGiven the time/effort, let me focus on the highest-value changes and ensure consistency. Let me start with README.md, which is the most important.\n\nActually, let me step back and think about what \"correct\" means here and how much to write. The README.md is already quite good and mostly reflects the current architecture (it mentions pi as backend, init-pi, theme, etc.). Let me check what's outdated in README.md specifically:\n\nLooking at the current README.md:\n- It has the \"pi 作为受控的执行后端\" section (good, current).\n- But it still references old concepts in some places:\n  - \"rick tools doing_check 校验执行结果\" (doing_check deleted)\n  - \"内部模块划分\" — actually the README doesn't have a module list that I saw, but let me check.\n  - The \".rick/ 目录结构\" section shows old structure (loops/skills/domain/draft) which is actually correct now.\n  - The \"版本演进\" section shows v3.1.5 etc.\n\nWait, actually the current README.md looks fairly current (it was updated in earlier tasks). Let me check what specifically is outdated.\n\nKey things to check in README.md:\n1. \"rick tools doing_check\" reference — outdated (doing_check deleted).\n2. Does it mention 三层金字塔 (three-layer pyramid)? No.\n3. Does it mention spec 信息内核? No.\n4. Does it mention env 四职责? Partially (init-pi description covers some).\n5. Does it mention 下沉策略 (sinking strategy)? No.\n\nSo the README.md needs:\n1. Add a section on 三层金字塔 (three-layer architecture: cli/handler/env+builder+runtime).\n2. Add spec 信息内核 concept.\n3. Add env 四职责.\n4. Add 下沉策略.\n5. Remove \"doing_check\" reference.\n\nLet me find all outdated references in README.md first.\n\nLet me grep README.md for outdated concepts."}}
