ucture, there's a \"---\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 双维度知识体系\" right after the pi section. Let me insert the new architecture section between them.\n\nLet me write the new section content and make the edits.\n\nActually, I realize I should be efficient here. Let me write the key sections and make all README edits in one go.\n\nLet me draft the new sections:\n\n### 架构：三层金字塔（rick 做薄）\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph L1[\"第一层 入口\"]\n        CLI\n    end\n    subgraph L2[\"第二层 调度聚合\"]\n        handler\n    end\n    subgraph L3[\"第三层 执行\"]\n        env\n        builder\n        runtime\n    end\n    subgraph L4[\"第四层 基础设施\"]\n        pi\n        workspace\n        config\n    end\n\n    CLI --> handler\n    handler --> env\n    handler --> builder\n    handler --> runtime\n    env --> pi\n    builder --> pi\n    runtime --> pi\n```\n\nText:\n- **第一层 入口（CLI）**：`internal/cmd` 路由命令、解析参数。\n- **第二层 调度聚合（handler）**：`internal/handler` 编排 env → builder → runtime。\n- **第三层 执行（env / builder / runtime）**：env 保证环境就绪、builder 拼提示词、runtime 拉起 pi。\n- **第四层 基础设施（pi / workspace / config）**：pi 是唯一 runtime（dsh 预留扩展 seam）。\n\n#### env 四职责\n1. 安装/更新 pi agent\n2. 安装/更新 pi 生态扩展/插件/skill\n3. 安装/更新 rick 自有 hook/skill/agent 定制\n4. 提供 pi 功能点就绪 check（不含 session）\n\n#### 下沉策略（rick 做薄）\n- dag 调度 → pi workflowScript 编排\n- 门禁 → pi hook（rick-gates 扩展）+ 确定性脚本\n- think/research/exporter → pi 自定义 agent\n\n#### 扩展 seam（单一 runtime pi + dsh 预留）\n- Runtime / RuntimeEnv / RuntimeBuilder 三接口 + config `runtime` 字段\n\n### spec 信息内核\n- `.rick/domain/spec.md`（规范）+ `.rick/domain/rick-spec.md`（实例）\n- 四要素：模块边界 / 职责 / 接口契约 / 验收标准\n- 功能等价 = 通过所有功能验收\n\nOK, let me write these.\n\nActually, I realize the scope of this documentation task is quite large, and I need to be careful about time. Let me focus on:\n1. README.md — add the key sections + fix outdated refs (highest priority).\n2. wiki/ — delete obsolete files + rewrite README/architecture + fix key modules.\n\nLet me write efficiently. I'll do the README first.\n\nFor the