参数\n- **[调度聚合模块](modules/handler.md)** - 编排 env → builder → runtime\n- **[环境模块](modules/env.md)** - env 四职责\n- **[提示词拼接模块](modules/builder.md)** - templates + pibuilder + xxxxbuilder\n- **[运行时模块](modules/runtime.md)** - 拉起 pi + 采集行为轨迹\n- **[提示词管理模块](modules/prompt.md)** - 模板管理、上下文注入\n- **[工作空间管理](modules/workspace.md)** - 路径解析\n- **[配置管理](modules/config.md)** - `~/.rick/config.json`\n- **[human-loop 模块](modules/human-loop.md)** - SENSE 深度思考\n\n## 核心命令速查\n\n```bash\n# 初始化 pi（rick 的 agent runtime）+ 扩展 + 主题\nrick tools init-pi\n\n# 规划任务\nrick plan \"任务描述\"\n\n# 执行任务（dag 调度下沉 pi workflowScript，门禁下沉 rick-gates）\nrick doing job_n\n\n# 知识积累\nrick learning job_n\n\n# 全局反思\nrick dream\n```\n\n## 版本信息\n\n- **当前版本**：v3.2.0（三层金字塔重构：rick 做薄，dag 调度/门禁/agent 下沉 pi）\n- **Go 版本要求**：>= 1.21\n- **支持平台**：macOS, Linux\n\n## 相关资源\n\n- **项目仓库**：[GitHub](https://github.com/sunquan/rick)\n- **spec 信息内核**：`.rick/domain/spec.md`（规范）+ `.rick/domain/rick-spec.md`（实例）\n- **Skills 库**：`.rick/skills/` - 可复用技能库\n- **Loops 库**：`.rick/loops/` - 可复用工作流\n- **Learning 记录**：`.rick/jobs/*/learning/` - 历史项目的知识积累\n","path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/wiki/README.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":131,"output":1096,"cacheRead":169216,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":51,"totalTokens":170443,"cost":{"input":0.000056985000000000004,"output":0.00095352,"cacheRead":0.0006134080000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0016239130000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786917032190,"responseId":"283256dc-1ddf-439a-9781-f775f8f0ee76","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_g1mB9B9ry4ry4QKii6Ia7099","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 2537 bytes to /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/wiki/README.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786917043411}]}
