``\n\nSo it returns cwd/bin/rick if it exists. In temp/, I need bin/rick. Let me copy it.\n\nLet me set up the isolated test. This is the cleanest way to do a real run without polluting the project.\n\nLet me create the temp setup and run it.\n\nActually, let me reconsider time budget. The real doing run involves:\n1. pi parent reading the prompt and calling subagent (1 LLM turn).\n2. workflowScript execution (worker runs the task).\n3. worker LLM turn (creates file + commits).\n4. parent writes tasks.json.\n5. settle.\n\nThis could take 2-5 minutes (deepseek-v4-pro with thinking). Let me set a timeout of 15 minutes.\n\nLet me create the isolated test environment.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_sPMOnpe0tBElVzSmGD9s7448","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && ACCEPT_DIR=$(mktemp -d -t rick_accept_XXXXXX) && echo \"ACCEPT_DIR=$ACCEPT_DIR\" && mkdir -p \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/jobs/job_accept/plan\" \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/skills/rick-gates\" \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/loops\" \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/skills\" \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/domain\" \"$ACCEPT_DIR/bin\" && cp .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py\" && cp bin/rick \"$ACCEPT_DIR/bin/rick\" && cat > \"$ACCEPT_DIR/.rick/jobs/job_accept/plan/task1.md\" << 'EOF'\n# 依赖关系\n无\n\n# 任务名称\nAcceptance smoke test\n\n# 任务目标\n在仓库根目录创建 acceptance.txt 文件，内容为字符串 OK\n\n# 关键结果\n1. acceptance.txt 存在且内容为 OK\n\n# 测试方法\ntest -f acceptance.txt && grep -q OK acceptance.txt\nEOF\ncd \"$ACCEPT_DIR\" && git init -q && git config user.email \"test@rick.local\" && git config user.name \"Rick Test\" && git add -A && git commit -q -m \"init\" && echo \"$ACCEPT_DIR\" > /tmp/rick_accept_dir.txt && echo \"setup done\" && ls -la"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":225,"output":1619,"cacheRead":202624,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1246,"totalTokens":204468,"cost":{"input":0.000097875000000000