复 handler DIP 与 dry-run 模板变量 + 改写集成测试\n2. docs(task12): README + wiki 同步三层金字塔/spec/env四职责/下沉策略\n3. chore(task12): rebuild bin/rick\n4. chore(task12): mark task12 success in tasks.json\n\nOr combine into fewer commits. The readme-wiki-sync-loop says COMMIT: `git add README.md wiki/ .rick/jobs/<job_id>/` + `git commit -m \"docs(<job_id>): <概述>\"`.\n\nLet me do a clean commit structure:\n1. `feat(task12): 修复 handler DIP(注入 Runtime 接口) + 持久化 session_id + human-loop dry-run max_backflows + 改写集成测试`\n2. `docs(task12): README + wiki 同步三层金字塔/spec 信息内核/env 四职责/下沉策略`\n3. `chore(task12): rebuild bin/rick`\n4. `chore(task12): mark task12 success in tasks.json`\n\nActually, let me keep it simpler and consistent with the pattern. But I need to be careful about what files go in each commit.\n\nLet me first check what files are modified/untracked now.\n\nLet me check git status to understand the current state and plan the commits.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_oKXFUhMZBhQZiKzj9cHN3666","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && git status --short"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":159,"output":841,"cacheRead":210176,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":778,"totalTokens":211176,"cost":{"input":0.000069165,"output":0.00073167,"cacheRead":0.0007618880000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0015627230000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786917600255,"responseId":"df8e885d-d030-4385-a1b6-5ef501dbd754","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_oKXFUhMZBhQZiKzj9cHN3666","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":" M .rick/domain/project-conventions.md\n M .rick/dream/prompts/dream_prompt.md\n M .rick/dream/prompts/skill_gen_loop.md\n M .rick/dream/prompts/skill_sense.md\n M .rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tasks.json\n M .rick/loops/tdd-red-green-refactor-loop.md\n M README.md\n M bin/rick\n M internal/cmd/doin