 global configuration for Rick CLI\ntype Config struct {\n\tMaxRetries       int             `json:\"max_retries\"`\n\tRuntime          string          `json:\"runtime\"`\n\tPiPath           string          `json:\"pi_path\"`\n\tPiExtraArgs      []string        `json:\"pi_extra_args,omitempty\"`\n\tDefaultWorkspace string          `json:\"default_workspace\"`\n\tGit              GitConfig       `json:\"git\"`\n\tHumanLoop        HumanLoopConfig `json:\"human_loop\"`\n}\n\n// GitConfig represents Git-related configuration\ntype GitConfig struct {\n\tUserName  string `json:\"user_name\"`\n\tUserEmail string `json:\"user_email\"`\n}\n\n// HumanLoopConfig represents human-loop specific configuration\ntype HumanLoopConfig struct {\n\tMaxRetries            int                `json:\"max_retries\"`\n\tResearchSourceWeights map[string]float64 `json:\"research_source_weights,omitempty\"`\n\tThinkTopN             int                `json:\"think_top_n,omitempty\"`\n\tSenseMaxBackflows     int                `json:\"sense_max_backflows,omitempty\"`\n\tThinkMinAssumptions   int                `json:\"think_min_assumptions,omitempty\"`\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786916472116},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_02_ACqEfZ39uzDJzVCKkIjm6919","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"internal/runtime/runtime.go:44:type Runtime interface {\ninternal/builder/xxxxbuilder.go:26:type RuntimeBuilder interface {\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786916472116},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! There's a discrepancy:\n- KR8 says `grep -rn 'piRuntime' internal/handler/` should be 0 (handler depends on interface, not concrete impl). But it found 2 hits.\n- `grep -rn 'piRuntime' internal/handler/ | wc -l` = 2.\n\nWait, let me check that. Actually the grep found 2 lines. Let me look at those.\n\nAlso, I need to check the RuntimeEnv interface location. The KR8 says `grep -q 'type RuntimeEnv interface' internal/env/*.go`. It passed.