` and pi syntax more carefully.\n\nActually, the more pressing issue is `dream --dry-run` FOUND `{{` placeholder. That's a real bug — unresolved template variables. Let me check the dream dry-run output.\n\n2. `ctrl --dry-run --job job_N`: fails because `job_N` doesn't have a doing directory. The KR says `ctrl --dry-run --job job_N`. But `job_N` is a placeholder. Maybe I should use a real job like `job_35`. Let me test `ctrl --dry-run --job job_35`.\n\nActually wait, there IS a `.rick/jobs/job_N/` directory (untracked, listed in git status). Let me check what's in it. But `ctrl` requires a `doing` directory under the job. `job_N` doesn't have one. Let me check.\n\nLet me investigate dream dry-run `{{` and ctrl with job_35."}}
