 (it's a pi agent monitoring prompt). The ctrl prompt says \"你是 rick 的控制 agent\". Does it contain workflowScript or pi trigger? Let me quickly check.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_1yb75x6UORKi4hr74yDZ0629","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && ./bin/rick ctrl --dry-run --job job_35 2>&1 | grep -nE \"workflowScript|runs\\.run|subagent\\(|agent:'|pi |--append-system-prompt|agent_settled\" | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":103,"output":603,"cacheRead":111232,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":487,"totalTokens":111938,"cost":{"input":0.000044805,"output":0.00052461,"cacheRead":0.000403216,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0009726310000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786918217180,"responseId":"8cb27240-8f36-497f-a903-39bfbb1067e4","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_1yb75x6UORKi4hr74yDZ0629","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"49:      \"task_name\": \"重构 runtime 模块（pi 调用逻辑收口到 runtime 层）\",\n75:      \"task_name\": \"落地 env 模块（四职责：pi + 生态扩展 + rick 定制 + 就绪 check）\",\n104:      \"task_name\": \"注册 think/research/exporter 为 pi 自定义 agent（经 env 职责 3 落盘）\",\n149:      \"task_name\": \"让 pibuilder 产出单文件内聚的 pi 定制化规范产物\",\n163:      \"task_name\": \"把自然语言 subagent 触发词等价迁移为 pi 显式触发语法\",\n209:  running   — 正在执行（pi 后台运行中）\n225:      raw_session_coding.log   ← 实时 pi JSONL 事件流（任务执行中持续写入）\n233:### raw_session_coding.log — 实时 pi JSONL 事件流\n235:每行是一个 JSON 对象（pi `--mode json` 事件流），字段为 **camelCase**。关键事件类型：\n247:{\"type\":\"agent_settled\", ...}   → 终止信号（pi 不再输出内容，本次运行收尾）\n250:**读取方法**：tail 最后 30-50 行，关注 `tool_execution_start` 的 toolName/args（pi 在调什么工具）\n280:   - 从 pi JSONL 中提取最近的 `tool_execution_start` 的 toolName 和 args，展示给人类\n351:解析 pi JSONL，按时间顺序展示工具调用序列（toolName + args 摘要 + result/isError 状态）。\n361:- **无编排权**：ctrl 是单 agent 只读监控，不持 subagent 工具，不派发任何 child（不触发 `workflow